.1.3.6.1.4.1.10910.2.2.3.1.1.10.1.20	CHATEAU-CD-PRODUCT-MIB	cdPowerSupplyEvTrapEn	User settable to disable/enable Power Supply alarms and okay events. Persistent through system resets.
