.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.1	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixPlugInUnitDpuTable	The HNE Data Processor Unit (DPU) plug-in unit table.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.1.1	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixPlugInUnitDpuEntry	An entry in the HNE DPU plug-in unit table. An entry contains HNE specific plug-in information for a Data Processor Unit. This table parallels the salixAtmfM4PlugInUnitTable. However, only valid LIU indices of the salixAtmfM4PlugInUnitTable will contain information pertinent to a DPU.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.1.1.1	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixDpuProcessorType	The type of processor installed on the Data Processor Unit. mipsR4700(1) - MIPS R4700 RISC processor.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.2	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixPlugInUnitLiuTable	The HNE Line Interface Unit (LIU) plug-in unit table.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.2.1	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixPlugInUnitLiuEntry	An entry in the HNE LIU plug-in unit table. An entry contains HNE specific plug-in information for an LIU. This table is indexed the same as the salixAtmfM4PlugInUnitTable. However, only valid LIU indices of the salixAtmfM4PlugInUnitTable will contain information pertinent to an LIU.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.2.1.1	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixLiuOrderwireEnabled	Indication of whether the orderwire is enabled. true(1) - the orderwire is enabled false(2) - the orderwire is not-enabled
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.2.1.2	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixLiuOrderwireSonetLine	Identifies which of the SONET lines on the plug-in unit to take the orderwire from for drop to the handset.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.2.1.3	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixLiuOrderwireSonetLayer	Identifies which of the two orderwire signals in the selected SONET line should be routed to the handset on the plug-in unit.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.3	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixPlugInUnitSyncTable	The HNE Sync module plug-in unit table.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.3.1	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixPlugInUnitSyncEntry	An entry in the HNE Sync module plug-in unit table. An entry contains HNE specific plug-in information for a Sync module. This table is indexed the same as the salixAtmfM4PlugInUnitTable. However, only valid Sync module indices of the salixAtmfM4PlugInUnitTable will contain information pertinent to a Sync module.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.3.1.1	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixSyncSlotIdentifier	Indicates whether the Sync module is installed in the primary or secondary plug-in unit slot.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.6	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixPlugInUnitXcdrTable	The Transcoder (xcoder) plug-in unit table.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.6.1	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixPlugInUnitXcdrEntry	An entry in the XCDR table. On entry exists for each Transcoder in the system. Each entry contains information and configuration about the Transcoder
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.6.1.1	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixPlugInUnitXcdrPercentWorkingDsp	Represents the percentage of the Dsp's on the Transcoder that are currently working. The exact Dsp's that have failed can be found in the itxDspConfigTable from the SALIX-ITX-MIB
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.6.1.2	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixPlugInUnitXcdrType	This object describes the Type of Transcoder described by the entry. voipServer(1) - A Transcoder that is limited to VOIP calls toneAndAnnouncementServer(2) - A Transcoder that is limited to announcements and tones universalServer(3) - A Transcoder that can do both Annoucements and VOIP calls
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.7	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixPlugInUnitDs3LiuTable	The DS3 Line Interface Unit (DS3LIU) plug-in unit table.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.7.1	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixPlugInUnitDs3LiuEntry	An entry in the SALIX Ds3Liu Plugin Unit Table. One entry exists for each DS3LIU in the system, and contains information specific to DS3LIUs.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.2158.5.1.5.1.1.7.1.1	SALIX-PRODUCT-PLUGIN-MIB	salixDs3LiuGroupNumber	The group that the DS3LIU corresponding to this entry belongs to. Valid groups are numbered from 1 to 4. A value of 0 indicates that the DS3LIU does not belong in a group.
