.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.3.1.15	ExaltComProducts	locLinkStateV	Vertical Link Status Alarm. -<g89><>
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.3.1.16	ExaltComProducts	locLinkStateH	Horizontal Link Status Alarm. -<g89><>
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.3.1.2	ExaltComProducts	locTempAlarm	The Temperature Alarm state. Possible values: - almNORMAL(0) - Normal temprature range - almMINOR(1) - Exceeding normal temprature range See Web, Monitor, Alarms, Temperature
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.3.1.3	ExaltComProducts	locCurrentTemp	The Internal Temperature in Celsius.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.3.1.4	ExaltComProducts	locCurrentTempS	The Internal Temperature as a string. 
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.3.1.9	ExaltComProducts	locLinkSecMismatch	This is link security mismatch alarm. This alarm tells if the Link Security Key is matching or not. Possible values: - almNORMAL(0) - Link Secutiry keys match - almMAJOR(2) - Link Secutiry keys do not match 
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.3.2	ExaltComProducts	locEthAlarms	
