.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.3.3.2.1	ExaltComProducts	locTe1AlarmsEntry	T1/E1 Alarms table Entry.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.3.3.2.1.1	ExaltComProducts	locTe1Alarm	The Alarms state for the Local T1/E1 Channel. Possible values: - almNORMAL(0) - Enabled and connection present - almMAJOR(2) - Enabled and no connection present - almDisable(3) - Disabled and no connection present - almNotAvailable(4) - T1/E1 channel is not available See Web, Monitor, Alarms, T1/E1 Input
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.4	ExaltComProducts	almRemote	
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.4.1	ExaltComProducts	remSysAlarms	
