.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.4.1.15	ExaltComProducts	remLinkStateV	Vertical Link Status Alarm. -<g89><>
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.4.1.16	ExaltComProducts	remLinkStateH	Horizontal Link Status Alarm. -<g89><>
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.4.1.2	ExaltComProducts	remTempAlarm	The Temperature Alarm state for far end radio. Possible values: - almNORMAL(0) - Normal temprature range - almMINOR(1) - Exceeding normal temprature range - almNotAvailable(4) - Telemetry is down See Web, Monitor, Alarms, Temperature
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.4.1.3	ExaltComProducts	remCurrentTemp	The Internal Temperature in Celsius for far end radio. 
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.4.1.4	ExaltComProducts	remCurrentTempS	The internal Temperature as a string for far end radio. 
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.4.1.9	ExaltComProducts	remLinkSecMismatch	This is link security mismatch alarm. This alarm tells if the Link Security Key is matching or not. Possible values: - almNORMAL(0) - Link Secutiry keys match - almMAJOR(2) - Link Secutiry keys do not match - almNotAvailable(4) - Telemetry is down 
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.4.2	ExaltComProducts	remEthAlarms	
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.4.3	ExaltComProducts	remTe1Alarms	
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.2.4.3.1	ExaltComProducts	remTe1LinkSummary	The T1/E1 Link Summary LED color. 
