.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.3.1.10	ExaltComProducts	locMinRSLstr	The Minimum RSL value as a string.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.3.1.100	ExaltComProducts	locMaximumTxModulation	The highest/maximum Tx modulation when ACM is enabled since the last counter reset. See Web, Monitor, Performance, Tx modulation.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.3.1.1000	ExaltComProducts	locResetStats	Write 'reset' to locResetStats to clear the Performance statistics.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.3.1.101	ExaltComProducts	locActiveTxModulation	The active Tx modulation when ACM is enabled. See Web, Monitor, Performance, Tx modulation.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.3.1.102	ExaltComProducts	locMinimumTxModulation	The lowest/minimum Tx modulation when ACM is enabled since the last counter reset. See Web, Monitor, Performance, Tx modulation.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.3.1.103	ExaltComProducts	locMaximumRxModulation	The highest/maximum Rx modulation when ACM is enabled since the last counter reset. See Web, Monitor, Performance, Rx modulation.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.3.1.104	ExaltComProducts	locActiveRxModulation	The active Rx modulation when ACM is enabled. See Web, Monitor, Performance, Rx modulation.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.25651.1.2.4.3.1.105	ExaltComProducts	locMinimumRxModulation	The lowest/minimum Rx modulation when ACM is enabled since the last counter reset. See Web, Monitor, Performance, Rx modulation.
