.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.13.2.1.1.5	C-PRODUCT-E3-MIB	e3PortResetTimeDate	The reset time and date of ATM stats on this ATM interface.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.13.2.1.1.6	C-PRODUCT-E3-MIB	e3PortResetStats	This field is used to reset the atm statistics for the e3 port. If a get is performed on this command, the result will always be zero
.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.13.2.1.1.7	C-PRODUCT-E3-MIB	e3PortUtilRxCells	The Utilization of received Cell is calculcated as received cells divided by Line Rate. 
