.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.13.3.1	C-PRODUCT-E3-MIB	e3PortClearStatsTable	The E3 reset statistics for peformance monitoring data.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.13.3.1.1	C-PRODUCT-E3-MIB	e3PortClearStatsEntry	Information about E3 port reset performance monitoring.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.13.3.1.1.1	C-PRODUCT-E3-MIB	e3PortResetPMData	This field is used to reset the performance monitoring data for the e3 port. If a get is performed on this command, the result will always be zero
