.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.14.1.1.1.2	C-PRODUCT-HSSI-MIB	hssiPortPeakRate	Peak data transfer rate of the HSSI port. Unit: Mbps.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.14.1.1.1.3	C-PRODUCT-HSSI-MIB	hssiPortScramble	ATM payload scrambling for the HSSI port.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.14.1.1.1.4	C-PRODUCT-HSSI-MIB	hssiPortLineRate	Physical Line data transfer rate of the HSSI port. Unit: CPS.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.14.2	C-PRODUCT-HSSI-MIB	hssiPortStats	
