.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.17.4.2.1.15	C-PRODUCT-ETHER-MIB	vcpStatsClearStats	This object will (1) clear the ATM statistics counters and (2) initialize the reset time and date to the current time and date for the specified ATM VC connection. NOTE: A value of '2' is returned for any attempted reads of this object.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.17.4.2.1.16	C-PRODUCT-ETHER-MIB	vcpStatsResetTimeDate	This object indicates the last time and date the ATM statistics were cleared for the specified ATM VC connection.
