.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.17.4.2.1.3	C-PRODUCT-ETHER-MIB	vcpOutFrames	The number of frames that have been transmitted by this vcp to its segment. Note that a frame transmitted on the interface corresponding to this vcp is only counted by this object if and only if it is for a protocol being processed by the local bridging function, including bridge management frames.
