.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.19.1.1.1.2	C-PRODUCT-IMA-MIB	imaCardTrafficType	This object indicates the traffic type selected for the card, cbr traffic will get higer priority. This parameter is not for a trunk card.
