.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.2.3.1.3	C-PRODUCT-BASE-MIB	shelfPowerSupplyOperStatus	Operational status for Power Supply. In AB9300/AB9100, it doesn't support any setting value. 
.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.2.4	C-PRODUCT-BASE-MIB	shelfPartNumber	Part number of the shelf.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.43.1.12.1.1.20	C-PRODUCT-GROUP-MIB	ctx	
