.1.3.6.1.4.1.850.1.1.3.3.3.4.1.4	TRIPPLITE-PRODUCTS	tlpEnvOutputContactCurrentState	The current state of the contact.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.850.1.1.3.3.3.4.1.5	TRIPPLITE-PRODUCTS	tlpEnvOutputContactInAlarm	Indicates whether or not the contact is in alarm.
