.1.3.6.1.4.1.850.1.2.3.1.2.1.4	TRIPPLITE-PRODUCTS	tlpAgentEmailContactAddress	The address of the email contact.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.850.1.2.3.2	TRIPPLITE-PRODUCTS	tlpAgentSnmpContacts	
